# Portal workflow

1. Read the lowest unchecked task in `docs/frontend-tasks.md` (or `../docs/frontend-tasks.md`).
2. Change only the files that task names.
3. Prefer the test first when the task lists concrete cases.
4. From the web root run, in order, every script that exists: `npm run format:check`, `npm run lint`, `npm run typecheck`, `npm test`, `npm run build`.
5. Commit with `docs/commit-guidelines.md` only after that gate is green. Subject under 50 characters. One task, one commit. Do not start the next task.

Load `implement-web-task` before feature work. Load `stay-on-contract` when a screen, label, query key, color, or library call is not already written in the task or the design docs. Do not invent it.

Stack: Next.js App Router, React, TypeScript strict, Tailwind, shadcn/ui on Base UI (`base-nova`), TanStack Query, React Hook Form, Zod, Recharts, Temporal, Vitest, Testing Library, MSW, Playwright. Do not add Radix.

`NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL` is the API origin with no trailing slash. The app does not connect to MongoDB.
